<header class="ref-head"><span class="hero-ornament"></span><h1 class="research-title">30 December in history</h1><p class="ref-lede">5 events that happened on 30 December, from 1460 to 2006.</p></header>
<ol class="day-events"><li class="tih-event-card"><div class="tih-event-main"><p class="tih-event-year">1460 CE <span class="tih-ago">566 years ago</span></p><h2 class="tih-event-title">Richard, Duke of York, is killed at Wakefield</h2><p class="tih-event-desc">Lancastrian forces defeated and killed Richard, Duke of York, near Wakefield. His son Edward avenged him at Towton three months later and took the throne as Edward IV.</p></div></li><li class="tih-event-card tih-has-thumb tih-event-hero"><p class="tih-hero-kicker">&#10022; Anniversary of the day</p><a class="tih-event-thumb" href="/encyclopedia/mexico-city" tabindex="-1" aria-hidden="true"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/mexico-city.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="168" height="112"></a><div class="tih-event-main"><p class="tih-event-year">1853 CE <span class="tih-ago">173 years ago</span></p><h2 class="tih-event-title">The Gadsden Purchase treaty is signed</h2><p class="tih-event-desc">US minister James Gadsden signed a treaty in Mexico City buying land south of the Gila River for a railway route. It fixed the modern border of southern Arizona and New Mexico.</p><div class="tih-tags"><a class="tih-tag enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/mexico-city">Mexico City</a></div></div></li><li class="tih-event-card"><div class="tih-event-main"><p class="tih-event-year">1916 CE <span class="tih-ago">110 years ago</span></p><h2 class="tih-event-title">Grigori Rasputin is murdered in Petrograd</h2><p class="tih-event-desc">Nobles led by Prince Felix Yusupov killed Rasputin, the mystic whose influence over the imperial family had become a scandal (17 December, Old Style). The murder did not save the monarchy, which fell weeks later.</p><div class="tih-tags"><a class="tih-tag tih-tag-profile" href="/empire/russian-empire">Russian Empire</a><a class="tih-tag enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/grigori-rasputin">Grigori Rasputin</a><a class="tih-tag enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/petrograd">Petrograd</a></div></div></li><li class="tih-event-card"><div class="tih-event-main"><p class="tih-event-year">1922 CE <span class="tih-ago">104 years ago</span></p><h2 class="tih-event-title">The Soviet Union is formally established</h2><p class="tih-event-desc">Delegates from Russia, Ukraine, Belarus and the Transcaucasian Federation approved the treaty creating the Union of Soviet Socialist Republics. It lasted until 1991.</p><div class="tih-tags"><a class="tih-tag enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/soviet-union">Soviet Union</a><a class="tih-tag enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/ukraine">Ukraine</a></div></div></li><li class="tih-event-card"><div class="tih-event-main"><p class="tih-event-year">2006 CE <span class="tih-ago">20 years ago</span></p><h2 class="tih-event-title">Saddam Hussein is executed in Baghdad</h2><p class="tih-event-desc">The former Iraqi president was hanged for crimes against humanity over the Dujail killings. A leaked mobile phone video of the jeering at his execution caused controversy.</p></div></li></ol>
